      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know i should call them but it's the weekend and they probably won't answer until monday. plus it feels more like just a dull ache or something. do u think it could just be inflammation from the incision? could i just take some extra ibuprofen or something to help it go down so i don't have to deal with the hassle of the clinic right now?",
