      "content": "it's just hard to drive back there and the waiting rooms are always such a mess. i just want to manage this at home for now. if i just keep the leg elevated and maybe use a warm compress or some ice, do you think that would be enough to keep the swelling from getting worse? i really don't think it's an emergency, it's just annoying.",
